c1 _ g(n) <= f(n) <= c2 _ g(n), for all n >= n0
Example
For f(n) = 3n^2 + 5n + 2,

We already know O(n^2) is the upper bound.

We also know Ω(n^2) is the lower bound.

So, the exact bound is Θ(n^2).

